          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Ngenyanga yokuqala, ngosuku lokuqala lwenyanga, uzathatha inkabi encinyane engelasici, uhlambulule indlu engcwele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpristi uzathatha elinye igazi lomnikelo wesono, alicombe emgubazini wethempeli lasezingonsini zealtare lasezinsikeni zamasango eguma langaphakathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakwenza okufananayo ngosuku lwesikhombisa lwenyanga ngenxa yomuntu owonileyo ngokuphosisa langokungazi, ukuze ulenzele ithempeli ukubuyisana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
